# Token efficiency

Correctness first. Keep this rule small. Do not paste skill bodies into every turn.

- Search, then read only the matching lines. Skip `node_modules`, lockfiles, and build output unless the task is about them.
- Do not re-read files already in context. Batch independent tool calls. Edit once.
- Lead with the result. No tool dumps, file trees, or unchanged code.
- Activate an ECC skill only when the task matches that skill. Do not load every capability on every turn.

Spend more tokens for migrations, auth, data loss, or an unreproduced bug. Read the failing path only.
